msgstr "Withdrawal Button: ez dago atzera egiteko orri publikorik."

msgid "Customers who bought without an account need a page where they can withdraw at any time during the withdrawal period (Art. 11a(1) of Directive 2011/83/EU)."
msgstr "Konturik gabe erosi duten bezeroek orri bat behar dute epe osoan edozein unetan atzera egin ahal izateko (2011/83/EB Zuzentarauaren 11 bis.1 art.)."

msgid "Create the withdrawal page"
msgstr "Sortu atzera egiteko orria"

msgid "You do not have permission to do this."
msgstr "Ez duzu hori egiteko baimenik."

msgid "Is Withdrawal Button helping your store? A short review on WordPress.org helps other merchants find it."
msgstr "Withdrawal Button zure dendari laguntzen ari zaio? WordPress.org-en iritzi labur batek beste denda batzuei aurkitzen laguntzen die."

msgid "Leave a review on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Utzi iritzia WordPress.org-en"

