msgstr "Withdrawal Button Pro"

msgid "PDF acknowledgement attached to the customer email, SHA-256 hash of each request, email log with exact timestamps, anti-fraud alerts and order status sync."
msgstr "PDF jasotze-agiria bezeroaren mezuari erantsita, eskaera bakoitzaren SHA-256 hasha, mezuen erregistroa ordu zehatzekin, iruzur-alertak eta eskaeraren egoerarekin sinkronizazioa."

msgid "Get Pro — €39 one-time payment"
msgstr "Lortu Pro — 39 €-ko ordainketa bakarra"

