msgid "For goods, the period starts when the customer receives them (Art. 9(2)(b) of Directive 2011/83/EU): mark the order as Completed when it is delivered. Until then the button stays available. Use the order date only if you sell services or digital content."
msgstr "Ondasunetan, epea bezeroak jasotzen dituenean hasten da (2011/83/EB Zuzentarauaren 9.2.b art.): markatu eskaera Osatua gisa entregatzen denean. Ordura arte botoiak erabilgarri jarraitzen du. Erabili eskaeraren data zerbitzuak edo eduki digitala saltzen badituzu bakarrik."

msgid "Do not show the button for orders with these statuses"
msgstr "Ez erakutsi botoia egoera hauek dituzten eskaeretan"

msgid "Do not exclude Completed: customers usually withdraw after receiving the order."
msgstr "Ez baztertu Osatua: bezeroek eskaera jaso ondoren egin ohi dute atzera."

