msgid "Show an optional reason field"
msgstr "Erakutsi arrazoirako eremu aukerakoa"

msgid "The customer never has to give a reason; the field is always optional."
msgstr "Bezeroak ez du inoiz arrazoirik eman behar; eremua beti da aukerakoa."

msgid "The acknowledgement of receipt is always sent to the customer, as required by Art. 11a(4)."
msgstr "Jasotze-agiria beti bidaltzen zaio bezeroari, 11 bis.4 artikuluak eskatzen duen bezala."

msgid "Customer email subject"
msgstr "Bezeroari bidalitako mezuaren gaia"

msgid "Leave empty for the default text in the store language. You can use {order_id} and {customer_name}."
msgstr "Utzi hutsik dendaren hizkuntzako testu lehenetsia erabiltzeko. {order_id} eta {customer_name} erabil ditzakezu."

